    "validate exact tokenizer bytes and all required tokenizer metadata before any dense, sparse, BGE-M3, or reranker ONNX session is committed",
    "document the mandatory provider-policy pair in every public ONNX construction example",
    "expose immutable committed-session access and profile finalization for Calyx placement attestation",
    "exclude upstream CI, doctests, and all test targets/modules under Astrolabe manual-FSV-only policy",
